        "id": "Penjelasan",
        "en": "Explanation"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.daily-health-explanation",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Menjaga kesehatan mencakup ikhtiar yang aman dan tidak menunda pertolongan yang diperlukan.",
        "en": "Caring for health includes safe effort and not delaying needed help."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.daily-health-example-heading",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": {
        "id": "Contoh dalam kehidupan",
        "en": "Life example"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.daily-health-example",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": {
        "id": "Seseorang tidak menunda pemeriksaan gejala serius dan meminta nasihat medis kompeten.",
        "en": "A person does not delay evaluation of serious symptoms and seeks competent medical advice."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block.daily-health-action-heading",
